ChatStats lets you import your WhatsApp™ chat histories and generates up to 24 beautifully crafted statistics to share to your groups!

With ChatStats, you can:
- Generate rankings of who sends the most and the least messages;
- Create a group overview showing members, number of messages, pictures, videos, voice messages and stickers sent;
- Inspect weekly and hourly messages' distribution through bar or radar plots;
- Check who sends the looongest messages;
- Create champions and rankings for each media type (pictures, videos, voice messages and stickers);
- Discover who sends the most links and emojis.

